<title>GERMANY: Mannesmann details final 96 results.</title>
<headline>Mannesmann details final 96 results.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mannesmann AG on Tuesday reported the following final results for 1996:</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated):</p>
<p>    Group net profit			    603    vs   701</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities   1,010    vs   911</p>
<p>    Group sales				34,683    vs 32,094</p>
<p>Of which:</p>
<p>	Domestic				 14,986    vs 14,088</p>
<p>	International			  19,689    vs 18,006</p>
<p>Income from ord. act. breakdown by business division:</p>
<p>	Engineering				  18    vs   278</p>
<p>	Automotive				  185    vs   115</p>
<p>	Telecommunications			947    vs   464</p>
<p>	Tubes and trading			(-92)   vs    38</p>
<p>	Other companies			  (-48)   vs    16</p>
<p>Sales breakdown by business division:</p>
<p>	Engineering			    15,235    vs 13,870</p>
<p>	Automotive				7,566    vs  7,200</p>
<p>	Telecommunicaitons		    4,209    vs  2,716</p>
<p>	Tubes and trading		     6,654    vs  6,796</p>
<p>	Other companies			 1,528    vs  2,001</p>
<p>    Group orders received		  35,758    vs 34,900</p>
<p>Orders breakdown by business division:</p>
<p>	Engineering			    15,795    vs 16,190</p>
<p>	Automotive				7,782    vs  7,331</p>
<p>	Telecommunications		    4,209    vs  2,716</p>
<p>	Tubes and trading		     6,715    vs  7,112</p>
<p>	Other companies			 1,242    vs  1,702</p>
<p>    Group investment			  3,420    vs  2,668</p>
<p>	Engineering				 850    vs    877</p>
<p>	Automotive				  397    vs    389</p>
<p>	Telecommunications		    1,932    vs    938</p>
<p>	  Of which:</p>
<p>	  Mannesmann Mobilfunk		  753    vs    857</p>
<p>	  Arcor				   1,045    vs    n/a</p>
<p>	  Eurokom				   134    vs     81</p>
<p>	Tubes and trading			 306    vs    237</p>
<p>	Other companies			    95    vs    227</p>
<p>    Group workforce on Dec 31	    119,70    vs 122,684</p>
<p>Of which:</p>
<p>     Domestic				  78,008    vs 81,004</p>
<p>	International			   41,701   vs  41,680</p>
<p>	  NOTE - Full name of the german engineering comapny is</p>
<p>Mannesmann AG.</p>
</text>
